# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# CinnabyteHQ environment
# Copy to `.env` and adjust. Nothing here is required for Phase 1.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Mock data layer: simulated network latency for service calls.
# Set to "off" to make every mock call resolve instantly.
MOCK_LATENCY=on

# ── Phase 2 (not used yet) ───────────────────────────────────
# Base URL of the future REST API. See src/services/http.ts.
# API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8080/api/v1

# PostgreSQL connection string used by the REST API service,
# NOT by this Astro app. See docs/BACKEND_INTEGRATION.md.
# DATABASE_URL=postgres://cinnabyte:cinnabyte@localhost:5432/cinnabyte
